[PRODUCT_NAME] is not working normally

The problem started at [EVENT_TIME] and is affecting [AFFECTED_SCOPE].
Every time in this email carries its timezone. We do not know the
cause yet, and we are not going to guess in this email. Everything
we have confirmed is below.

What we know so far

Status: [INCIDENT_STATUS]
Started: [EVENT_TIME]
Affected: [AFFECTED_SCOPE]
Next update: [NEXT_UPDATE_TIME]

Important: [WORKAROUND_TEXT]

We will send the next update by [NEXT_UPDATE_TIME], whether or not
the problem is fixed by then. We are not putting a time on the fix,
because we do not have one to give. Sorry for the trouble this is
causing you.

The status page has the current state and every update we have
posted.

Open the status page:

[STATUS_PAGE_URL]

If this is blocking something urgent, reply to this email or write
to [SUPPORT_EMAIL]. Tell us what you were doing when it failed. It
helps.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
